  This seems pretty obvious, but I haven't seen it mentioned here or in
any of the spoiler listings and it gives a BIG advantage!

  If you can tell the cursed status of objects (ie you're a priest or
you still have your pet) then you can try out armour and weapons in
a shop without paying.  Last night I found an armour shop and walked
out with boots of speed for 80gp and a cloak of invisibility for
60gp.  In almost every armour shop (and a few general stores) there
are one or more valuable items that can be identified in this way and
bought for next to nothing.

  You can also enscribe wands without paying (thus possibly identifying
them).  I haven't tested this fully, I think enscribing might use a charge
on some wands (such as lightning which blinds you), so don't attempt
this if you have no money (or if you do, don't blame me ;-).

